s first close above the base high of $187.75. Volume that day was 11.9M shares, 3.84x the prior 10-day average of 3.1M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $236.49, and the chart ends at $217.22.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}